  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Small, constitutionally neutral National Army (non-NATO, NATO Partnership for Peace, EU candidate with accession talks opened 2024). Mostly Soviet-era kit being slowly modernised with EU and partner aid (Piranha IIIH from Germany, Humvees, Piorun MANPADS). A Russian troop contingent remains in the breakaway Transnistria region; hybrid pressure (energy, disinformation, airspace violations by drones) is the main threat.",
